  ./bin/geoffrey add-email
  ./bin/geoffrey list-email
  ./bin/geoffrey memory --name "Person Name" [--business "Business Name"] [--github username] [--target PATH] [--push]
  ./bin/geoffrey packet --name "Person Name" [--business "Business Name"]
  ./bin/geoffrey share
  ./bin/geoffrey doctor

Commands:
  bootstrap    One-command friend setup: checks tools, Claude Code, email, and memory.
  setup        White-glove setup for Geoffrey and multi-account email.
  start        Print the first prompt to paste into Claude, Codex, or ChatGPT.
  walkthrough  Print the onboarding questions and app discovery flow.
  apps         Print the chief-of-staff app/tool inventory.
  connectors   Print the white-glove connector setup paths.
  demo         Print the first useful action menu.
  first-run    Print the exact first useful prompt to run after setup.
  first-win    Launch Claude Code into the first useful Geoffrey action.
  dashboard    Show a plain-English setup checklist and next action.
  status       Show what is connected and what to do next.
  connect-tool Help connect or plan the next business app/tool.
  update       Pull the latest Geoffrey package and refresh local setup.
  update-check Check for a Geoffrey update and ask before installing.
  schedule-updates
               Install the biweekly Geoffrey update check.
  install-launcher
               Install the one-word Geoffrey terminal launcher.
  install-desktop-button
               Install the double-click Geoffrey Desktop button.
  install-mac-app
               Build and install Geoffrey.app in the user's Applications folder.
  uninstall    Remove Geoffrey.app, its launcher, update job, and MCP registration.
               Use --purge-private-memory only to erase the separate private memory repo.
  app-status   Print the simple readiness information used by Geoffrey.app.
  app-migrate  Back up and inventory terminal-era private state for the Mac app.
  app-capabilities List the Claude skills, plugins, and MCPs Geoffrey can use.
  app-automations Discover recurring work without creating or changing schedules.
  app-automation-queue Queue missed approved local work without running it.
  app-automation-run Run one approved local workflow and record its result.
  app-automation-save Save a reviewed workflow to private GitHub-backed memory.
  app-automation-cloud-link Record owner-reviewed Claude Routine evidence.
  app-automation-cloud-import Import validated Claude Routine results without merging cloud changes.
  app-prompt   Print the safe, Geoffrey-aware prompt used by Geoffrey.app.
  app-context  Prepare the read-only private context used by Geoffrey.app.
